  -- Apply [Merge Pull Request](#merge-pull-request) for a task or Apply [Merge Epic Pull Request](#merge-epic-pull-request) for an epic, passing the verified [readiness evidence](#readiness-evidence) and authorization result. For an epic, also supply the [target requirements](#target-requirements) and exact verified head SHA.
